><article v-for="row in loanScheduleDetails(record).unpaidRows" :key="row.id" class="emi-row"><div class="emi-heading"><strong>EMI {{row.emiNumber}}</strong></div><div class="finance-metrics emi-summary"><div><span>Due date</span><strong>{{row.dueDate?.slice(0,10)||'—'}}</strong></div><div><span>EMI amount</span><strong>{{money(row.originalEmiAmount)}}</strong></div><div><span>Delayed interest</span><strong>{{money(Math.max(0,Number(row.unpaidOverdueInterest||0)))}}</strong></div></div></article></div><div v-else class="empty compact"><strong>No delayed or unpaid EMIs</strong><span>All due EMI obligations are currently settled.</span></div></div><div class="finance-metrics"><div><span>EMIs due</span><strong>{{entityFinancial(record).dueCount}}</strong></div><div><span>EMIs paid</span><strong>{{entityFinancial(record).paidDueCount}}</strong></div><div><span>Pending EMIs</span><strong>{{entityFinancial(record).pendingDueCount}}</strong></div><div><span>Pending scheduled amount</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).pending)}}</strong></div><div><span>Prepayment paid</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).prepaid)}}</strong></div><div><span>Remaining balance</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).remaining)}}</strong></div></div><div class="finance-actions"><button v-if="entityFinancial(record).remaining>0" @click="openAction('loanPayment',record)">Record payment</button></div><div v-if="loanHistory(record).length" class="finance-history"><span>Payment history</span><small v-for="item in loanHistory(record).slice(0,5)" :key="item.kind+item.date+item.amount">{{item.kind}} · {{item.date?.slice(0,10)}} · {{money(item.amount)}}</small></div></div><div v-else-if="selected==='compliance'&&entityFinancial(record)" class="entity-finance"><div class="finance-metrics"><div><span>Provision amount</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).provision)}}</strong></div><div><span>Actual cost</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).cost)}}</strong></div><div><span>Paid</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).paid)}}</strong></div><div><span>Provision balance</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).remaining)}}</strong></div></div><div v-if="sourcePaymentHistory(record).length" class="finance-history"><span>Payment history</span><small v-for="item in sourcePaymentHistory(record).slice(0,5)" :key="item.id">{{item.settledOn?.slice(0,10)}} · {{money(item.amount)}}</small></div></div><div v-else-if="selected==='maintenance'&&entityFinancial(record)" class="entity-finance"><div class="finance-metrics"><div><span>Provision amount</span><strong>{{entityFinancial(record).maintenanceProvision!=null?money(entityFinancial(record).maintenanceProvision):'—'}}</strong></div><div><span>Maintenance type</span><strong>{{(record.values||record).maintenanceType||'—'}}</strong></div><div><span>Date</span><strong>{{(record.values||record).performedOn||'—'}}</strong></div><div><span>Actual amount</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).cost)}}</strong></div><div><span>Paid</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).paid)}}</strong></div><div><span>Remaining</span><strong>{{money(entityFinancial(record).remaining)}}</strong></div></div><div v-if="sourcePaymentHistory(record).length" class="finance-history"><span>Payment history</span><small v-for="item in sourcePaymentHistory(record).slice(0,5)" :key="item.id">{{item.settledOn?.slice(0,10)}} · {{money(item.amount)}}</small></div></div><div v-if="actionRecord?.id===record.id&&actionKey==='loanPayment'" class="inline-action loan-payment-flow"><div class="section-label">RECORD PAYMENT</div><div class="payment-entry-grid"><label class="form-field"><span class="field-label">Actual payment date</span><input v-model="actionDraft.paidOn" type="date" :disabled="loading||paymentConfirmed" /></label><label class="form-field"><span class="field-label">Actual amount paid</span><input v-model.number="actionDraft.amount" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" :disabled="loading||paymentConfirmed" /></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="secondary" :disabled="loading" @click="closeAction">Cancel</button><button type="button" class="primary" :disabled="Number(actionDraft.amount)<=0||loading" @click="paymentCalculated=true;paymentConfirmed=false">Calculate payment</button></div><div v-if="loanPaymentPreview" class="payment-confirmation"><div v-if="loanPaymentPreview.available"><div class="section-label">CONFIRMATION · EMI ALLOCATION</div><div class="payment-allocation-list"><div v-for="allocation in loanPaymentPreview.allocations" :key="allocation.obligationId" class="payment-allocation-row"><div><strong>EMI {{allocation.obligationId.split(':').at(-1)}}</strong><span>{{loanScheduleDetails(record).dueRows.find(row=>row.id===allocation.obligationId)?.dueDate?.slice(0,10)}}</span></div><div><span>Delayed interest</span><strong>{{money(allocation.overdueInterest)}}</strong></div><div><span>Scheduled interest</span><strong>{{money(allocation.scheduledInterest)}}</strong></div><div><span>Principal</span><strong>{{money(allocation.scheduledPrincipal)}}</strong></div></div></div><div class="finance-metrics"><div><span>Payment to record</span><strong>{{money(actionDraft.amount)}}</strong></div><div><span>Remaining after payment</span><strong>{{money(Math.max(0,(entityFinancial(record)?.remaining||0)-Number(actionDraft.amount||0)))}}</strong></div></div><label class="confirmation-line"><input v-model="paymentConfirmed" type="checkbox" /> <span>I confirm this EMI allocation and want to record this payment.</span></label><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="primary" :disabled="!paymentConfirmed||loading" @click="saveAction(actionDraft)">Confirm &amp; record payment</button></div></div><p v-else class="message error">{{loanPaymentPreview.reason==='PAYMENT_EXCEEDS_EMI_OBLIGATIONS'?'Payment is greater than the currently payable EMI obligations. Record the excess separately as a prepayment after overdue obligations are settled.':loanPaymentPreview.reason}}</p></div></div></div><div class="actions"><template v-if="selected!=='settlement'"><button @click="edit(record)">Edit</button><button class="delete" @click="remove(record)">Delete</button></template><template v-else></template></div></article></div>
<div v-else class="empty"><div class="empty-icon">＋</div><strong>No {{baseDefinition.collectionTitle||baseDefinition.title}} records yet</strong><span>Create the first authoritative source record for this section.</span></div></section>
</template>
<template v-else>
<section class="settings-layout"><aside class="settings-menu"><div class="section-label">SETTINGS &amp; DATA</div><h2>Control centre</h2><button v-for="item in settingsMenu" :key="item.key" :class="{active:settingsSelected===item.key}" @click="chooseSetting(item.key)"><span class="settings-icon">{{item.icon}}</span><span><strong>{{item.title}}</strong><small>{{item.subtitle}}</small></span><b>›</b></button></aside>
<section v-if="settingsSelected==='backup'" class="settings-workspace"><div class="settings-heading"><div><div class="section-label">DATA PROTECTION</div><h2>Backup &amp; Restore</h2><p>One managed backup contains the complete recoverable KFE dataset, including settings.</p></div><span class="status">Protected</span></div><BackupRestorePanel /></section>
<section v-else-if="settingsSelected==='application'" class="settings-workspace"><div class="settings-heading"><div><div class="section-label">APPLICATION SETTINGS</div><h2>Application Settings</h2><p>Application-level preferences belong here rather than being mixed into business records.</p></div><span class="status">Settings</span></div><div class="info-card"><strong>Appearance</strong><p>Choose the display mode for the KFE interface. Auto follows the configured day/night schedule.</p><div class="theme-selector" role="group" aria-label="Theme mode"><button type="button" :class="{active:themeSettings.mode==='light'}" :aria-pressed="themeSettings.mode==='light'" @click="chooseTheme('light')">☀ Light</button><button type="button" :class="{active:themeSettings.mode==='dark'}" :aria-pressed="themeSettings.mode==='dark'" @click="chooseTheme('dark')">☾ Dark</button><button type="button" :class="{active:themeSettings.mode==='auto'}" :aria-pressed="themeSettings.mode==='auto'" @click="chooseTheme('auto')">◐ Auto</button></div></div><div class="info-card"><strong>Settings travel with backup and restore</strong><p>KFE application settings are part of the canonical backup/restore boundary. Backup/sync provider configuration remains separate from portable business data.</p></div></section>
<section v-else-if="settingsSelected==='synthetic'" class="settings-workspace"><div class="settings-heading"><div><div class="section-label">TEST DATA ONLY</div><h2>Test Data Reset</h2><p>Temporary development control for isolated synthetic data. It never touches the real KFE database or backup boundary.</p></div><span class="status">Temporary</span></div><SyntheticDataPanel /></section>
<section v-else class="settings-workspace"><div class="settings-heading"><div><div class="section-label">DESTRUCTIVE DATA CONTROL</div><h2>Data Reset</h2><p>Permanently clear the canonical KFE dataset. The application itself remains installed.</p></div><span class="status danger">Destructive</span></div><div class="reset-card"><div><h2>Reset all KFE data</h2><p>This clears canonical business records. Local backup copies are not deleted, so a backup can be restored afterward.</p></div><button class="reset-button" :disabled="loading" @click="resetData">Reset all data</button></div><p v-if="error" class="message error">{{error}}</p><p v-if="notice" class="message notice">✓ {{notice}}</p></section></section>
</template>
</section>
</template>


